{'query': 'average cost of daily meals per person in India 2024', 'results': [{'title': 'How Much Does a Typical Meal Cost in India? - Detailed Budget ...', 'url': 'https://go-lanka.in/how-much-does-a-typical-meal-cost-in-india-detailed-budget-guide', 'snippet': 'Discover how much a typical meal costs across India, from cheap street snacks to upscale dining, with regional price tables, budgeting tips, and FAQs for savvy travelers.'}, {'title': 'India Food Prices Dashboard | Daily Retail Food Price Tracker ...', 'url': 'https://foodprices.isignal.in/', 'snippet': '3 hours ago · Track daily retail food prices across India with IndiaSpend’s interactive dashboard. Compare prices of essential commodities like onions, wheat, rice, pulses, and vegetables across states and cities.'}, {'title': 'Meal costs are rising faster than earnings: Data - The Hindu', 'url': 'https://www.thehindu.com/data/meal-costs-are-rising-faster-than-earnings-data/article68796170.ece', 'snippet': 'Oct 28, 2024 · On average, the cost of a healthy meal has increased by 52% in October 2024 compared to the same month last year. Meanwhile, average salaries and wages have increased in the range of 9 to 10%'}, {'title': 'A New Dashboard Shows the Cost of a Healthy Diet Across India', 'url': 'https://thewire.in/food/a-new-dashboard-shows-the-cost-of-a-healthy-diet-across-india', 'snippet': 'Around 40% of the population in rural areas and 10% of the population in cities in India cannot afford two vegetarian meals a day priced at Rs 30 per meal, found an analysis of data...'}, {'title': 'Cost of Living in India. Prices in India. Updated Sep 2026', 'url': 'https://www.numbeo.com/cost-of-living/country_result.jsp?country=India', 'snippet': 'Average prices of more than 40 products and services in India. Prices of restaurants, food, transportation, utilities and housing are included.'}], 'result_count': 5, 'duration_seconds': 2.3460070000146516}
{'query': 'cheap vegetarian dinner recipes with ingredient costs', 'results': [{'title': 'Budget-friendly Vegetable Recipes', 'url': 'https://uk.pinterest.com/ideas/budget-friendly-vegetable-recipes/943501442208/', 'snippet': 'Dinner Idea Cheap. Cheap Meal Ideas. 13 Dirt Cheap Meals That Cost A Penny. 31 Best Recipes to Eat Healthy on a Budget | Easy recipes on a budget, Cheap and easy asian recipes, Money saving recipes.'}, {'title': 'Find and save ideas about easy cheap vegetarian meals on Pinterest.', 'url': 'https://www.pinterest.com/ideas/easy-cheap-vegetarian-meals/949058032118/', 'snippet': 'Vegetarian Healthy Dinner Ideas. Cheap Vegetable Meals.30+ Cheap Vegan Meals with Simple Ingredients. Budget-Friendly Vegetarian Meals Under $2 per Serving | Cheap meatless meals, Cheap meatless dinners, Affordable vegetarian recipes.'}, {'title': '5 Budget-Friendly Vegetarian Dinners Under... - Passion For Savings', 'url': 'https://www.passionforsavings.com/5-budget-friendly-vegetarian-dinners-under-20-for-a-family-of-four/', 'snippet': 'cheap vegetarian dinner ideas Vegetarian Dinners Under $20. You’d be surprised just how affordable it can be to create healthy, vegetarian dinners for your family! vegetarian dinners under $20 curry 1. Chickpea & Spinach Curry (Cost: $10-$12).'}, {'title': 'Alberta Cheap Dinners Under $5: $2.50 Skillet | eezly', 'url': 'https://eezly.com/blog/alberta-cheap-dinner-recipes-under-5-budget-meals/', 'snippet': 'Vegetarian Patties cost $65.46 in Alberta for 14 servings, or $4.68 per serving, making them a cheap dinner recipe under $5 with a broader ingredient list.'}, {'title': 'On a budget? Try these 12 cheap vegan meals - VegKit.com', 'url': 'https://www.vegkit.com/blog/lifestyle/on-a-budget-try-these-cheap-vegan-meals/', 'snippet': 'Keep costs low and nutritional value high with this nifty recipe for curried veg and flatbread. It’s a match made in cheap-yet-healthy-meal heaven, loaded with plant-based goodness and complex carbohydrates that will leave you feeling fuller for longer.'}], 'result_count': 5, 'duration_seconds': 2.482244700018782}
