{'query': 'cheap breakfast and lunch recipes with ingredient costs', 'results': [{'title': '27 Cheap Breakfast Ideas: Recipes for Easy, Budget-Friendly Meals', 'url': 'https://www.tasteofhome.com/collection/cheap-breakfast-ideas/', 'snippet': 'May 19, 2025 · Inexpensive breakfast recipes make the most of these basic ingredients, delivering variety without compromising on flavor. This collection of low-cost breakfast options includes practical choices for busy weekday mornings and robust weekend brunch options for feeding a sleepy crew.'}, {'title': '60 Meals for $70 | Cheap and EASY Breakfast, Lunch, and ...', 'url': 'https://wholeandhappyliving.com/2023/10/01/60-meals-for-70-cheap-and-easy-breakfast-lunch-and-dinner-recipes/', 'snippet': 'Oct 1, 2023 · I wanted to create a budget-friendly 5-day meal plan that included breakfast, lunch, and dinner options and I came up with some delicious meals that our whole family loved.'}, {'title': 'Budget Recipes - 60+ Ideas For Cheap, Easy & Healthy Meals', 'url': 'https://yummyinspirations.net/budget-recipes/', 'snippet': 'Budget Recipes – 60+ Ideas for cheap meals including easy healthy breakfast, lunch, dinner, snacks and desserts with low budget, super frugal ingredients. These budget recipes have all been tried, tested and enjoyed through my 11+ years of food blogging.'}, {'title': '150 Super Cheap Meals for When You Are Flat Broke', 'url': 'https://www.prudentpennypincher.com/super-cheap-recipes/', 'snippet': 'Dec 26, 2023 · Eat well on a budget with these super cheap meals. There are easy and cheap recipes for breakfast, lunch, and dinner.'}, {'title': '34 Cheap Lunch Ideas: Inexpensive Meals for Busy Days', 'url': 'https://www.tasteofhome.com/collection/cheap-lunch-ideas/', 'snippet': 'Jun 25, 2025 · These cheap lunch ideas, from hearty soups to easy wraps, are simple, filling and satisfying recipes to power you through busy days.'}], 'result_count': 5, 'duration_seconds': 9.326639100036118}
